Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 18:37:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(net)!: modernize game packets and validate responses

Use required request models and Mapperly for game music score requests. Enforce JSON nullability and report failed response deserialization through TrySetResponse. Synchronize networking test sources and query implementations.

BREAKING CHANGE: INetQuery.SetResponse is renamed to TrySetResponse, and the five game packet classes are now internal.

